& [Projection] preserves a bounded sanitized runtime refusal as structuredContent with MCP isError true

& [EvidenceBranch] is conditional and exact
  + a refusal without run identity remains unverified infrastructure or pre-evidence failure
  + a refusal with run identity must use a canonical UUID and invoke verify for that exact identity
  + verification requires current profile verified status run kind exact evidence ID recorded fault status admission not_applicable and canonical manifest digest
  + successful negative verification is returned beside runtime and fault objects

& [Failure] is strict
  + malformed run identity verifier transport fault wrong profile wrong record status wrong evidence identity or admitted account returns evidence_verification_failed
  + no negative verification may change isError true or acquire proposal authority

& [Acceptance] is measurable
  + [RRE-001] source and manifest verify
  + [RRE-002] refusal runtime object is preserved without private reasoning fields
  + [RRE-003] canonical archived refusal returns matching negative verification and isError true
  + [RRE-004] unverifiable mismatched or admission-bearing negative evidence fails closed
  + [RRE-005] infrastructure fault without run identity makes no verification claim
  + [RRE-006] selected route direct MCP and EVO-X2 regressions pass

& [Signature] is bounded implementation authority
  + [signature_uuid] is 089408d9-dd2c-4455-bfbf-d4f88ddd0adf
  + [source_manifest_sha256] is F534C83F207688953E8DF7EF009ED660D91E450E6D6C2AA5CE997CC2D53DF361
  + [authority_scope] is refusal projection negative verifier integration tests isolated deployment proof and closure
  + [invalidation] is retry selection promotion reasoning disclosure inferred evidence identity or changed query_sop authority
